        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Monkey on My Back\", \"Pump\", \"Same Old Song and Dance\"\n- People: Steven Tyler, Joe Perry\n- Organizations: Aerosmith\n- Roles: lead singer, lead guitarist, guitarist\n- Concepts: \"Demon of Screamin'\", vocal range\n\nFacts:\n- Aerosmith is an American hard rock band.\n- \"Monkey on My Back\" is a song by Aerosmith.\n- \"Monkey on My Back\" was written by Steven Tyler and Joe Perry.\n- \"Monkey on My Back\" was released on Aerosmith's 1989 album \"Pump\".\n- Steven Tyler is Aerosmith's lead singer.\n- Joe Perry is Aerosmith's lead guitarist.\n- Steven Tyler is known as the \"Demon of Screamin'\" because of his high screams and wide vocal range.\n- \"Same Old Song and Dance\" was written by Steven Tyler and Joe Perry.\n- Joe Perry is also identified as a guitarist.",
